    "black dot P on the screen, labeled",
    "teal ray r1 from S1 to P with short drawn wave train, labeled r1",
    "teal ray r2 from S2 to P with short drawn wave train, labeled r2",
    "dashed horizontal centerline from slit midpoint to point C on screen, C labeled",
    "bracket y marking vertical offset from C to P",
    "bracket D marking barrier-to-screen distance",
    "dashed line from slit midpoint to P making angle θ with the horizontal, θ labeled",
    "panel (b): magnified near-slit construction with the same barrier, slits, and bracket d",
    "two parallel teal rays inclined at θ, each arrowed and labeled 'to P'",
    "dashed reference lines and θ angle arcs at each slit",
    "dashed segment from the upper slit meeting the lower ray at a marked right angle",
    "short segment labeled δl (path difference) on the lower ray",
    "panel labels (a) and (b)"
  ],
  "interactions": [
